{
    "0": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Seems like what Reimu said about another reality is true."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That kind of powerful human I am feeling",
                "is not from Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Show yourself. Stranger."
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So this is Gensokyo's supreme God."
            ]
        },
        "156_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You should be Okina Matara,",
                "the other Sage."
            ]
        },
        "164_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Nice to meet you. My lady."
            ]
        },
        "172_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Your respect is a jewel.",
                "I want to know your name."
            ]
        },
        "180_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My name is Xaero.",
                "One of the Guardians from the land I'm from."
            ]
        },
        "188_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It may sound very rushed, but our dear friend",
                "is preparing an important banquet."
            ]
        },
        "196_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It should be good if you assist.",
                "For having better relations."
            ]
        },
        "204_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She will be happy for seeing a friend",
                "of her ex-master Yukari."
            ]
        },
        "212_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So this is what Yukari meant..."
            ]
        },
        "220_0": {
            "lines": [
                "They are so very kind, but I know what they are planning."
            ]
        },
        "228_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My luck on finding this Guardian around here."
            ]
        },
        "236_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ha! Well done. But I know what you are trying to do."
            ]
        },
        "244_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What are you talking about?"
            ]
        },
        "252_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Give up! Gensokyo is none of your bussines!",
                "Don't you want to fight against me."
            ]
        },
        "260_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You think as a God you can pass me by?"
            ]
        },
        "268_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I can use my right to defend myself!"
            ]
        },
        "276_0": {
            "lines": [
                "One bullet in the air and that",
                "ego you bear will be destroyed!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Time out."
            ]
        },
        "38_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You won't be able to defeat me.",
                "But this fight leads to nowhere."
            ]
        },
        "46_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Seriously. I thought Gensokyo's Gods",
                "were not so impulsive."
            ]
        },
        "54_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, that's making a stereotype.",
                "But be sure of this:"
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "We won't fight without reason."
            ]
        },
        "70_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Okay, your words got me.",
                "I recognise me error."
            ]
        },
        "78_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I would be proud of going to that festivity."
            ]
        },
        "86_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And I'm curious about knowing what kind of person",
                "made Yukari chose her as an aprendice."
            ]
        },
        "94_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But Gensokyo suffers a bad situation I must attend first."
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's always time for everything.",
                "Don't worry."
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "By the way. I noticed you have a",
                "wicked power with you~."
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Perhaps Reimu wanted to share",
                "our essence with her people."
            ]
        },
        "126_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You say... this stone..."
            ]
        },
        "134_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It was yours?"
            ]
        }
    }
}